<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60677" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύκνος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>swan, Cycnus olor</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύκνων δουλιχοδείρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.460
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				316
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				620a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eratosth.
				<u>Cat.</u>
				25
			</span></i>, etc.; sacred to Apollo, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				870
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				85b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				5
			</span></i>: Com., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάτραχοι κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					207
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύκνου δίκην τὸν ὕστατον μέλψασα
					θανάσιμον γόον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1444
				</span></i>
			: hence, metaph., <i>minstrel, bard,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				7.19
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> kind of
			ship, prob. from its prow being curved like a
				<i>swan's</i> neck, <i><span class="en">
				Nicostr.Com.
				10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>eye-salve</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.708
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				759
			</span></i>, etc. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῡ</span> by
			position in 
				Ep.
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				2.82
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				16.49
			</span></i> in pr. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κύκνος</span>.]</div>
